{
  "_note": "Stripe 今日 / 本月 / 近 30 天(mode):余额流水按设备时区的起点取、按分类求和(groupSum,无循环)。金额是最小货币单位,按币种小数位换算;只统计主币种(余额数组第一项)。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "zh",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "语言:文案在取数层按语言出(切语言 = 整盘重取,数据缓存含 locale)。没注入 @app 时按英文(overseas-first §2)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "modeIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${mode},today)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。mode = today / month / d30。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "本地今天零点(毫秒;parseDate 按设备时区)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "m0",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(connect::(formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM),-01),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "本地本月 1 日零点。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "d0",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(calc::(${nowMs}-2505600000),yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "近 30 天 = 今天 + 往前 29 个自然日(29 × 86400000 = 2505600000)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "since",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(if::(eq::(${modeIn},month),${m0},if::(eq::(${modeIn},d30),${d0},${t0}))/1000),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "起点(UTC 秒)。⚠️ 进 URL 的数字过 parseNumber(Android calc 返回 2026.0 这类 double)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "Pm",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${modeIn},today),4,8)]"
      },
      "_note": "最多翻几页(每页 100 条)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tr",
        "value": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "concurrent",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "bal",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1/balance",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "15000",
            "credential": "stripe",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1/balance_transactions?created%5Bgte%5D=${since}&limit=100",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "15000",
            "credential": "stripe",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "余额(取主币种与 livemode)与第 1 页流水并发。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent / credential.state 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(老宿主晚一拍合并)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_f",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bal.object},x),balance),0,1)]"
      },
      "_note": "响应不是 balance 对象(401 未授权 / 403 缺权限 / 网络失败)= 取数失败(G26):宿主贴上次成功的那帧。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${_f}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "stripe unavailable"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lm",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bal.livemode},true),false),0,1)]"
      },
      "_note": "测试密钥(rk_test_)拿到的是测试数据:livemode=false → 组件上标「测试数据」。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_SYM",
        "value": {
          "usd": "$",
          "eur": "€",
          "gbp": "£",
          "jpy": "¥",
          "cny": "¥",
          "krw": "₩",
          "inr": "₹",
          "hkd": "HK$",
          "twd": "NT$",
          "aud": "A$",
          "cad": "CA$",
          "nzd": "NZ$",
          "sgd": "S$",
          "mxn": "MX$",
          "brl": "R$",
          "ils": "₪",
          "php": "₱",
          "thb": "฿",
          "vnd": "₫",
          "try": "₺",
          "pln": "zł ",
          "uah": "₴"
        }
      },
      "_note": "币种符号表(只收写成符号不歧义的;其余写 ISO 代码)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_DEC",
        "value": {
          "bif": "0",
          "clp": "0",
          "djf": "0",
          "gnf": "0",
          "jpy": "0",
          "kmf": "0",
          "krw": "0",
          "mga": "0",
          "pyg": "0",
          "rwf": "0",
          "ugx": "0",
          "vnd": "0",
          "vuv": "0",
          "xaf": "0",
          "xof": "0",
          "xpf": "0",
          "bhd": "3",
          "jod": "3",
          "kwd": "3",
          "omr": "3",
          "tnd": "3"
        }
      },
      "_note": "Stripe 零小数位 / 三位小数币种(其余 2 位)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cur",
        "value": "$[toLowerCase::(findNotEmpty::(${bal.available[0].currency},usd))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "curU",
        "value": "$[toUpperCase::(${cur})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "curS",
        "value": "${curU}"
      },
      "_note": "没有符号的币种写大写代码;代码与数字之间的不换行空格由 money() 在拼接**中间**加 —— set 会裁掉值两端的空白(JS trim 连 U+00A0 一起裁),放在 curS 末尾必丢(2026-10-10 真令牌验出「MYR0.00」)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "curC",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "1 = 没有符号、写的是代码(money() 据此在代码后加不换行空格)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "curY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${_SYM},${cur}),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${curY},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "curS",
            "value": "${curY}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "curC",
            "value": "0"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "curD",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${_DEC},${cur}),2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "curV",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(1,1),if::(eq::(${curD},0),1,if::(eq::(${curD},3),1000,100)),1)]"
      },
      "_note": "最小单位 → 主单位:Stripe 金额是最小单位(美分),零小数位币种(日元)本身就是主单位。"
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "_SYM"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "_DEC"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "KS",
        "value": [
          "currency",
          "reporting_category"
        ]
      },
      "_note": "groupSum 的键列:先按币种、再按分类 → {usd:{charge:…,refund:…}}。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ONE",
        "value": {
          "balance_transaction": "1"
        }
      },
      "_note": "mapField 查表:每行补一列 one=1,groupSum 求它 = 笔数。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kCh",
        "value": "$[connect::(${cur},.charge)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kRf",
        "value": "$[connect::(${cur},.refund)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "kDp",
        "value": "$[connect::(${cur},.dispute)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_f1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${p1.object},x),list),0,1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${_f1}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "stripe balance_transactions unavailable"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hm1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${p1.has_more},false),true),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ls1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(pluck::(${p1.data},id),calc::(length::(${p1.data})-1)),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "R1",
        "value": "$[mapField::(${p1.data},object,${ONE},one,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g1",
        "value": "$[groupSum::(${R1},${KS},amount)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n1",
        "value": "$[groupSum::(${R1},${KS},net)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[groupSum::(${R1},${KS},one)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tr",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${Pm},1),eq::(${hm1},1)),1,${tr})]"
      },
      "_note": "翻到上限那一页还有下一页 = 只统计了最近 Pm × 100 笔(卡上如实说)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "R1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "remove",
      "props": {
        "key": "p1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "go2",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hm1},0),1),le::(2,${Pm})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${go2}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1/balance_transactions?created%5Bgte%5D=${since}&limit=100&starting_after=${ls1}",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "15000",
            "credential": "stripe",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b2",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent / credential.state 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(老宿主晚一拍合并)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_f2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${p2.object},x),list),0,1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "${_f2}"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "stripe page 2 unavailable"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "hm2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${p2.has_more},false),true),1,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ls2",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(pluck::(${p2.data},id),calc::(length::(${p2.data})-1)),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "R2",
            "value": "$[mapField::(${p2.data},object,${ONE},one,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "g2",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R2},${KS},amount)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "n2",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R2},${KS},net)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "c2",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R2},${KS},one)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tr",
            "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${Pm},2),eq::(${hm2},1)),1,${tr})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "remove",
          "props": {
            "key": "R2"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "remove",
          "props": {
            "key": "p2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "上一页还有(has_more)且没到上限才翻;翻页拿不到 = 失败,不拿半截数冒充全量。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "go3",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hm2},0),1),le::(3,${Pm})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${go3}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1/balance_transactions?created%5Bgte%5D=${since}&limit=100&starting_after=${ls2}",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "15000",
            "credential": "stripe",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b3",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent / credential.state 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(老宿主晚一拍合并)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_f3",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${p3.object},x),list),0,1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "${_f3}"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "stripe page 3 unavailable"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "hm3",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${p3.has_more},false),true),1,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ls3",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(pluck::(${p3.data},id),calc::(length::(${p3.data})-1)),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "R3",
            "value": "$[mapField::(${p3.data},object,${ONE},one,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "g3",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R3},${KS},amount)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "n3",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R3},${KS},net)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "c3",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R3},${KS},one)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tr",
            "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${Pm},3),eq::(${hm3},1)),1,${tr})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "remove",
          "props": {
            "key": "R3"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "remove",
          "props": {
            "key": "p3"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "go4",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hm3},0),1),le::(4,${Pm})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${go4}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "p4",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1/balance_transactions?created%5Bgte%5D=${since}&limit=100&starting_after=${ls3}",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "15000",
            "credential": "stripe",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b4",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent / credential.state 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(老宿主晚一拍合并)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_f4",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${p4.object},x),list),0,1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "${_f4}"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "stripe page 4 unavailable"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "hm4",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${p4.has_more},false),true),1,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ls4",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(pluck::(${p4.data},id),calc::(length::(${p4.data})-1)),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "R4",
            "value": "$[mapField::(${p4.data},object,${ONE},one,0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "g4",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R4},${KS},amount)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "n4",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R4},${KS},net)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "c4",
            "value": "$[groupSum::(${R4},${KS},one)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tr",
            "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(${Pm},4),eq::(${hm4},1)),1,${tr})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "remove",
          "props": {
            "key": "R4"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "remove",
          "props": {
            "key": "p4"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "go5",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hm4},0),1),le::(5,${Pm})),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${go5}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "p5",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1/balance_transactions?created%5Bgte%5D=${since}&limit=100&starting_after=${ls4}",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "15000",
            "credential": "stripe",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
